{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THE DEMO PACKAGE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With this early development Demo we want to give you access to the following features in order to hear what you think:\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Wummsen Classic Fighting Mode (Local 1v1)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The brand new Wummsen Beats Stage - Be aware as the beats could beat you! (Local 1v1)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ONE BUTTON - CRAZY COMBOS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your attacks follow a Revolver System. Pressing the attack button three times in a row, will also launch three different attacks towards your opponent. This makes it simple for beginners as you can get used to the controls quickly. Realy pros learn to use the revolver cycle in there gameplay smoothly and therefore dish out loads of damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900090/extras/c5e9ca9c043a77d59be96fbccd3105e6.poster.avif?t=1753891208\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900090/extras/c5e9ca9c043a77d59be96fbccd3105e6.webm?t=1753891208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900090/extras/c5e9ca9c043a77d59be96fbccd3105e6.mp4?t=1753891208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3900090?t=1753891208","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3900090?t=1753891208","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900090/588c22b1fe797e56b636b1f3ecf3d89f46b4556f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753891208","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900090/